        Arratihc.#speaker:{firstChar_tag()} #inkA:{ink_tag_a(firstChar_InkLevel)} #inkB:{ink_tag_b(firstChar_InkLevel)}  #inkC:{ink_tag_c(firstChar_InkLevel)}  #inkD:{ink_tag_d(firstChar_InkLevel)}  #ewWord:{em_state(Influenced)} #portrait:chitarra_annoyed
        Uh.#speaker:{firstChar_tag()} #inkA:{ink_tag_a(firstChar_InkLevel)} #inkB:{ink_tag_b(firstChar_InkLevel)}  #inkC:{ink_tag_c(firstChar_InkLevel)}  #inkD:{ink_tag_d(firstChar_InkLevel)} #ewWord:{em_state(Influenced)} #portrait:chitarra_neutral
        Prova tu.
        Come ti chiami?
        
